{"seq":4,"slug":"organization","title":"组织驱动力","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cross-discipline/developer-productivity/organization","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"team-topologies","title":"团队拓扑与交互模式","url":"/h/cross-discipline/developer-productivity/organization/team-topologies","wordCount":1345,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"platform-as-multiplier","title":"平台团队的生产力乘数效应","url":"/h/cross-discipline/developer-productivity/organization/platform-as-multiplier","wordCount":1255,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"engineering-culture","title":"工程文化与持续改进","url":"/h/cross-discipline/developer-productivity/organization/engineering-culture","wordCount":1301,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"# 组织驱动力\n\n本章探讨生产力的组织级杠杆——技术手段能优化个体效率，但团队拓扑、协作模式、工程文化才是决定组织整体吞吐的结构性因素。47% 的开发者时间花在沟通协调上，这意味着组织设计本身就是最大的生产力干预点。\n\n学完本章，你将掌握 Team Topologies 的四种团队类型与交互模式、理解平台团队如何通过自助服务降低认知负荷 40-50%、以及如何构建「持续改进」文化使生产力提升成为自驱动循环而非一次性项目。\n"}